{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54142","headline":"歌 · 罗汉和尚","name":"歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"咸通七载初参道，到处逢言不识言。\n心里痴（《五灯会元》作「疑」）团若栲栳，三春不乐止林泉。\n忽遇法王毡上坐，便陈疑恳向师前。\n师从毡上那伽起（一作「定」），袒膊当胸打一拳。\n骇散痴（《五灯会元》作「疑」）团獦狚落，举头看见日初圆。\n从兹蹬蹬以碣碣，直至如今常快活。\n只闻肚里饱膨脝，更不东西去持鉢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗汉和尚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}